OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain expected, with perhaps some heavy
OL,7,Fand thundery showers during the
OL,8,Fevening.
OL,9,
OL,10,CFriday:FCloudy with further outbreaks
OL,11,Fof rain, perhaps heavy and persistent
OL,12,Fat times. Heaviest rain most likely
OL,13,Facross eastern coasts at first, but
OL,14,Fanywhere by afternoon. Some parts
OL,15,Fperhaps staying dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
